<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1912_7121.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freuendtlich willig dienst, sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehrenn liebs und guots vermoegent zuvor. From fuersichtig
<lb n="3"/>ersam wyß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insundrers</unclear> guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossenn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hie</unclear> durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrib</unclear>
